ry":"UCrest Berhad, an investment holding company, engages in the design, development, and marketing of information technology related products and services in Malaysia and Singapore. The company offers iMedic cloud hospital that is used by doctors and patients for the diagnosis, management, and treatment of chronic diseases, such as cardiovascular diseases (CVD), cancer, diabetes, hypertension, sleep apnea, stroke rehabilitation, and other diseases in the United States, China, Singapore, Malaysia, Taiwan, Indonesia, Vietnam, and the Middle East. It also provides mobile healthcare services. The company was formerly known as Palette Multimedia Berhad and changed its name to UCrest Berhad in November 2017. UCrest Berhad was incorporated in 1997 and is based in Petaling Jaya, Malaysia.","zh":"UCrest Berhad 是一家投资控股公司，在马来西亚和新加坡从事信息技术相关产品和服务的设计、开发与营销。公司前身为 Palette Multimedia Berhad，于2017年11月更名为 UCrest Berhad，1997年成立，总部位于马来西亚八打灵再也。","lines":["iMedic 云医院：供医生和患者用于慢性病（如心血管疾病、癌症、糖尿病、高血压、睡眠呼吸暂停、中风康复等）的诊断、管理和治疗，服务美国、中国、新加坡、马来西亚、台湾、印度尼西亚、越南和中东地区。","移动医疗服务：提供移动医疗相关服务。"],"lines_en":["iMedic cloud hospital: used by doctors and patients for diagnosis, management, and treatment of chronic diseases such as cardiovascular diseases, cancer, diabetes, hypertension, sleep apnea, and stroke rehabilitation in the US, China, Singapore, Malaysia, Taiwan, Indonesia, Vietnam, and the Middle East.","Mobile healthcare services: provides mobile healthcare services."]}}